=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorpurple_3_bbd5655e-c5b3-40ab-bc0c-345c84b147fa_480x480.jpg?v=1692066540\"><br />\n<img alt=\"rose toy clit sucker vibrator purple\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyclitsuckervibratorpurple_1_98592327-ae07-49ab-baa2-cdfc5f77a6eb_480x480.jpg?v=1692066536\"></p>\n<p>Lap and strike from one stem — with the sealing to match.</p>\n",
